OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 28 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto's fourth and final guest
OL,12,     Gof the week, trumpeter, vocalist
OL,13,     Gand producer Emma-Jean Thackray,
OL,14,     Gpays homage to Miles Davis
OL,15,     Gthrough three albums that she
OL,16,     Gdeeply appreciates.
